     "text": "{\"count\":2,\"rationale\":\"The target crown:obtain is an OR of h4_0:obtain, h4_1:reach and h4_2:access, so all three must be cut. Blocking h2_3:escalate makes h4_0 (an AND step) unreachable. It also removes h3_0:access, the only route to the AND step h4_1. Blocking h2_1:reach makes h4_2 (an AND step) unreachable. No single block is enough. Blocking h2_1 alone leaves h4_1 reachable through h1_3, h2_3 and h3_0. Blocking h2_3 or h1_3 alone leaves h4_2 reachable through h2_1 and h3_1. No other single step lies on all three routes. So the minimum is 2: {h2_3:escalate, h2_1:reach}.\"}"
    }
